---

<BaseLayout
  title="IT Recycling Company UK â€” Secure and Certified IT Recycling Services | Techsteps"
  description="Techsteps delivers audited technology lifecycle solutions across the UK: high-security IT asset disposition (ITAD), climate-controlled records management, DIN 66399 mobile shredding, and specialist data centre relocations."
>
  <!-- Section 1 â€” Hero -->
  <HeroHome />

  <!-- Section 2 — Corporate Introduction & Impact: Proven Results. Trusted Performance. -->
  <Section padding="pt-4 sm:pt-6 pb-8 md:pb-10" className="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#f1f4ef] text-slate-900">
    <!-- Ambient World Dots Watermark Background in Upper Section -->
    <div class="absolute top-6 right-0 w-full lg:w-2/3 h-72 sm:h-96 pointer-events-none opacity-25 select-none overflow-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
      <img
        src="/images/brand/world-dots.svg"
        alt=""
        class="w-full h-full object-contain object-right-top block"
        loading="eager"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>

    <!-- Soft radial eco ambient glow -->
    <div class="absolute top-16 -left-20 w-80 h-80 rounded-full bg-emerald-100/30 blur-3xl pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <Container className="relative z-10">
      <!-- 1. Top Module: Header & Impact Overview (matching design reference) -->
      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-end justify-between gap-6 mb-6 sm:mb-8">
        <!-- Left Column: Eyebrow + Headline + Subtitle + Accent Line -->
        <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-3">
          

          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold font-display text-brand-navy tracking-tight leading-[1.15]">
  We Create Meaningful Impact.<br class="hidden sm:inline" />
  <span>Deliver Builds a Better Future.</span>
</h2>

          <!-- <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
            Delivering secure, sustainable and reliable lifecycle services across every stage of your IT and information assets.
          </p> -->

          <div class="w-12 h-1 bg-[#146B5C] rounded-full mt-3"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Column: Eco-Tech Circular Badge -->
        <div class="hidden sm:flex items-center justify-end self-end pb-1">
          <img
            src="/images/components/batch2.png"
            alt="Eco-Tech Circular Lifecycle Badge"
            class="w-28 h-28 sm:w-36 sm:h-36 lg:w-44 lg:h-44 xl:w-48 xl:h-48 object-contain drop-shadow-md hover:scale-105 hover:rotate-6 transition-all duration-500"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
